  partName: Cylinder Head Cover Plate (2)
  description: The Cylinder Head Cover Plate (2) is a tiny, thin-flat component located
    at the top-center-front of the engine, fabricated from Material.005, which offers
    excellent thermal resistance. Its primary function is to protect the cylinder
    head from debris and contaminants, while also providing a secure mounting point
    for other components. Interestingly, the cover plate's design allows for minimal
    weight while maintaining maximum protection, making it an essential component
    in the engine's overall design.
